; frame notches for keyed stand feet
; generated by emitter.py
; frame notches: 2 (3.2mm wide, 12.0mm deep, 200mm apart) along the bottom (X) stock edge, puzzle-job frame (disc bbox 0..290, cut from y=-10) -- the MDF back is not cut
; SAME machine frame as the puzzle cut (disc bbox 0..290): run it on the same sheet without moving it -- coordinates reach -5.5 / 295.5 (the stock edges)
; warmup: 1000ms = 5.8mm fwd half / back to start
;
;HEAD: laser
;MATERIAL: plywood_veneer_3ply_3mm
;LASER_MODE: static  (M3 — dwell-burn-through risk if motion stalls)

$32=1   ; GRBL laser mode
G21     ; mm
G90     ; absolute
M5      ; laser off
G0 X0 Y0

; --- stand path 1/2 ---
G0 X43.400 Y-10.000
M3 S1000
F350
G1 X43.400 Y-7.083
G1 X43.400 Y-10.000
G1 X43.400 Y7.000
G1 X46.600 Y7.000
G1 X46.600 Y-10.000
M5

; --- stand path 2/2 ---
